  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="7.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAs">III As</ref> 7.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Si tunc sit aliquis qui tot homines habeat, quod non sufficiat omnes custodire, præponat sibi singulis villis præpositum unum, [talem prepositum] qui credibilis ei sit, et qui concredat hominibus.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If, however, there is anyone who has so many men, that he is not able to control them, he shall place each estate in charge of a reeve, whom he can trust, and who will trust the men.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
